# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RoastMyBag.ai — environment template
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Every key below is read SERVER-SIDE only
# (API route handlers). None is prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_, so none is inlined
# into the browser bundle — a boundary pinned by a test in
# app/api/__tests__/secret-boundary.test.ts.
#
# The app degrades to a curated demo profile when a key is absent, so it
# still runs with this file empty — but the AI roast and the voice are the
# product, and both need real keys.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── OpenAI (the roast) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Powers GPT-4o roast generation in app/api/roast/route.ts.
# Get from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# ── ElevenLabs (the voice) ───────────────────────────────────
# Text-to-speech for the spoken roast in app/api/tts/route.ts.
# Get from: https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your-elevenlabs-key-here

# Voice to speak the roast in. Browse and copy an ID from the voice library.
# Get from: https://elevenlabs.io/app/voice-library
ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=your-voice-id-here

# ── Moralis (the chain data) ─────────────────────────────────
# BNB Chain token-transfer history used by lib/bscscan.ts.
# Without it, /api/scan serves a demo profile instead of live chain data.
# Get from: https://admin.moralis.io/web3apis
MORALIS_API_KEY=your-moralis-key-here
